  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sir_Kent.jpg\" title=\"Sir Kent the Artisan\"><img alt=\"Sir Kent the Artisan\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"216\" src=\"/images/Sir_Kent.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sir_Kent.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Sir Kent the Artisan</div></div></div>\n<p>Sir Kent the Artisan is a loner NPC who has a studio on Level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.  The door to it is locked, and can be opened by killing the <a href=\"/wiki/Particularly_Rude_Broodling\" title=\"Particularly Rude Broodling\">Particularly Rude Broodling</a>, who is sometimes nearby but sometimes in other areas of the Level 1.  Sir Kent is a quest-giver with a twist.  His quests are:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Monkeysphere_Cutbacks\" title=\"Monkeysphere Cutbacks\">Monkeysphere Cutbacks</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_Dungeon_Gray\" title=\"Paint the Dungeon Gray\">Paint the Dungeon Gray</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_Dungeon_Green\" title=\"Paint the Dungeon Green\">Paint the Dungeon Green</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_Dungeon_Red\" title=\"Paint the Dungeon Red\">Paint the Dungeon Red</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_by_the_Bucket\" title=\"Paint by the Bucket\">Paint by the Bucket</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
